布。</section><section style=\"margin-top: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\"><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.5; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.2; border-radius: 1px;\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #0052d9; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.85; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;\">SYS.ACTIVE</section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0 0 35px 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.08); border-top: 5px solid #0052d9; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 20px 20px;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><section style=\"background-color: #0052d9; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px; letter-spacing: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.2;\">CORE 02</section><section style=\"margin-left: 12px; flex: 1; height: 1px; background-color: rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.15);\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 900; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">优惠最高 24%：苹果海外上架官翻 M4 iPad Pro</section></section><section style=\"width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 0; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-product-hub/main/data/images/5fe23b8681fb1e1bef326324cebea611.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; max-height: 600px; height: auto; border: none; object-fit: cover; object-position: top;\" /></section><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 30px 20px;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 1.85; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.8px; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">苹果于2026年4月在美国官网上架翻新版M4 iPad Pro，提供11英寸和13英寸两种尺寸。11英寸版起售价759美元（约5233元人民币），较原价999美元优惠约24%；13英寸版起售价1019美元（约7026元人民币），较原价1299美元优惠约22%。产品提供Wi-Fi与蜂窝网络版本，存储空间256GB起步。所有翻新设备均经过苹果严格检测、维修、清洁并重新包装，配备完整配件与手册，享有一年官方保修，并支持加购AppleCare+。该产品原为2024年5月发布，在2025年10月M5系列推出后停售，此次翻新上架为消费者提供了高性价比选择。截至发稿，苹果中国官网的翻新产品列表中暂未出现M4 iPad Pro。</section><section style=\"margin-top: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\"><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.5; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.2; border-radius: 1px;\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #0052d9; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.85; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;\">SYS.ACTIVE</section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0 0 35px 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.08); border-top: 5px solid #0052d9; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 20px 20px;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><section style=\"background-color: #0052d9; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px; letter-spacing: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.2;\">CORE 03</section><section style=\"margin-left: 12px; flex: 1; height: 1px; background-color: rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.15);\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 900; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">三星承认 Galaxy S26 Ultra 手机 3x 变焦存在画面模糊情况，正开发修复补丁</section></section><section style=\"width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 0; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-product-hub/main/data/images/68370daef67c1e13899ba8726eb94421.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; max-height: 600px; height: auto; border: none; object-fit: cover; object-position: top;\" /></section><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 30px 20px;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 1.85; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.8px; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">三星已正式承认其旗舰手机Galaxy S26 Ultra存在3倍长焦变焦成像质量问题。根据韩国社区论坛及科技媒体Android Authority的报道，大量用户反馈在切换到3x变焦模式时，照片会出现明显模糊或柔和，细节丢失，尤其在强光及夜间闪光灯环境下更为严重。值得注意的是，5x变焦的成像则表现正常。三星技术团队经核查确认，此问题源于软件层面的图像处理错误，发生在镜头切换过渡期间，并非硬件故障。目前，三星正在积极开发修复补丁，并承诺在完成测试后尽快推送给用户，但尚未公布具体的发布日程。</section><section style=\"margin-top: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\"><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.5; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.2; border-radius: 1px;\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #0052d9; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.85; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;\">SYS.ACTIVE</section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0 0 35px 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.08); border-top: 5px solid #0052d9; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 20px 20px;\"><secti